    <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="../../../../javahelp.css">
    <title>Changing the name of a state from a node</title>
  </head>
  <body bgcolor="#ffffff">
    <h1>
       <img border="0" hspace="0" height="32" width="32" src=
      "../../../../images/carmenHelpIcons/c3_32.gif">&nbsp; Changing the name of a state from a
      node
    </h1>
    <table border="1" cellpadding="7" style=
    " page-break-inside: auto; page-break-before: auto; page-break-after: auto;" cellspacing="0"
    bordercolor="#000000" width="491">
      <tr>
        <td colspan="2" valign="top" width="475">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <b>Use case: Changing the name of a state from a node</b>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td colspan="2" valign="top" width="475">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <b>Actor: User</b>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="229">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <b>Normal course</b>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="232">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <b>Alternative courses</b>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      </THEAD><TBODY>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="229">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <font size="3">1.During the edition of the properties of a node, the name of an state
            of the variable of the node which is being edited is changed.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="232">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="229">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <font size="3">2.The change of the name of an state is notified to its child nodes to
            update the different table of potentials.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="232">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="229">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <font size="3">3.A new point to undo and redo the change of the name of the state of
            the node is created.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="232">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      </TBODY>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
